/*
Pokémon Indigo gym leaders. 6v6 doubles, Gen IX sets.

Construction: five core mons share the gym type (primary or secondary);
one off-type safety covers a weakness. Dual typing on the core five is
preferred. Cohesion (weather, terrain, Trick Room, Tailwind) beats
stacking resists. Opening pair is first in the party; safety is last.

Vanilla TRAINER_LEADER_BROCK / MISTY / etc. are unchanged. Gym scripts
still use those IDs until the FLAG_INDIGO engine and gym maps switch over.

Display names are profession titles, capped at TRAINER_NAME_LENGTH 10.
Full titles: Naturalist, Caretaker, Entrepreneur (Magnate), Lighthouse
Keeper (Keeper), Apothecary, Mountaineer (Climber), Conservationist
(Botanist), Craftsman, Illusionist (Magician), Restaurateur (Chef),
Martial Artist (Sensei), Wildlife Warden (Warden), Broadcaster (Anchor),
Mine Surveyor (Surveyor), Historian, Expedition Leader (Explorer),
Engineer, Entomologist (Researcher). Pics are FRLG placeholders.

Ace levels follow documentation/rom-completion.md (Viridian 12 …
Sunyshore 70). Heatran and Tornadus (Incarnate) are intentional gym mons.
*/

